---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Kept in the Way</h1>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <p>This blog is intended to be an encouragement for Christians who seek to be kept in the Way of Jesus by the guidance of the Holy Spirit.</p>

  <blockquote>
    Whether you turn to the right or to the left, your ears will hear a voice behind you, saying, "This is the way; walk in it."
  </blockquote>

  <p class="citation">Isaiah 30:21-22</p>
</section>

<section class="recent-posts">
  <h2>Recent Posts</h2>

  {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        <li>
          <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | longDate }}</p>
          <p>{{ post.templateContent | excerpt(30) }}</p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty-state">No posts yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
